    "title": "Trial date set after Fall River paraprofessional accused of assaulting student - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ken Paiva ,\n23 hours ago A trial date has been set for a Fall River Public School paraprofessional placed on leave after an alleged assault of a student. According to court records, 25-year-old Natasha Burgo was arraigned back in January in Fall River District Court and has been charged with Assault and Battery with a Dangerous Weapon on a Child Under 14. Read full article",
